| `showcase` | boolean | `true` | `true`, `false` | copier `_exclude` and `_migrations` | `false` drops the showcase demo: `src/backend/showcase`, `api/rest_fastapi/showcase_api.py`, `scripts/jobs/export_showcase_static.py`, `scripts/jobs/build_llms_txt.py`, `tests/unit/backend/test_showcase.py`, `tests/integration/test_showcase_repo.py`, `tests/integration/test_showcase_api.py`, `tests/unit/scripts/test_export_showcase_static.py`, `tests/unit/scripts/test_build_llms_txt.py`, `tests/e2e/test_showcase_journey.py` and `docs/guides/showcase-site.md`, and an update removes `wiki/llms.txt` and `wiki/llms-full.txt`. | the frontend: `frontend_stack` | always |
